    "legal": "What legal considerations arise from assigning US territorial rights to the biotech and EU/UK rights to the pharma, particularly regarding IP ownership, regulatory approvals under FDA and EMA/British regulations, and potential post-Brexit changes?",
    "finance": "How should we model the rNPV of this asset for valuation purposes, incorporating upfront payments, milestone schedule, tiered royalties, and territorial splits, and what financial metrics (e.g., IRR, NPV) would best capture deal economics?"
  },
  "requires_recency_disclosure": true,
  "recency_notes": "FDA accelerated approval guidance updates post-2023, EMA regulatory changes after Brexit, recent EU IP law amendments, current oncology drug pricing trends."
